id: twinned-spirits
name: Twinned Spirits
talentCategory: racial
race: yardrat
prerequisites: Yardrat, Synchronized Combatants Talent
description: >
  Through extreme synchronization, your battle partner has effectively become an extension of your own soul.
text: >
  Twinned Spirits: Through extreme synchronization, your battle partner has effectively become an extension of your own soul.
  –Prerequisites: Yardrat, Synchronized Combatants Talent
  (1)-[Passive]: You are always Bonded to your Partner, but you cannot become Bonded with any other Character.
  (2)-[Passive]: Your Partner has their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T).

---

[passive]
# (1) Your Bonded Ally is your Partner (Synchronized Combatants'), whatever Power of the Weak (4) says - never another (conditions.mjs
# bondOf, bondOpen).
allow twinned.partner;
# (2) Read by your Partner on every Combat Roll: 1(T), yours (chat.mjs partyParts).
allow twinned.rolls;
